msgid "Allow relinking name-conflicted groups"
msgstr "Allow relinking name-conflicted groups"

msgid ""
"Lets a dataset blocked by a name conflict claim that existing, unclaimed "
"group by writing its code/UID into the group's empty Code field, instead of "
"staying permanently blocked. Only ever applies to a group with no code that "
"isn't already linked to a different dataset — never overwrites one that's "
"already in use."
msgstr ""
"Lets a dataset blocked by a name conflict claim that existing, unclaimed "
"group by writing its code/UID into the group's empty Code field, instead of "
"staying permanently blocked. Only ever applies to a group with no code that "
"isn't already linked to a different dataset — never overwrites one that's "
"already in use."

